5,1,1,talk,George,,I worry about the silence. I want to see what sours groups like ours.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Toshio,,The arranging takes hours. I need to see where those evenings actually go.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Victoria,,The car is never ready. I need to know the state at handover.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Misaki,,A share is not a share. I need to see the real fuel costs.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Minato,,I don't know the total. I want to see the tax and insurance papers.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,George,,"@Minato, that is wise. We need the baseline before we argue.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Victoria, handover state is key. If it is dirty, the next person suffers.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Toshio, exactly. I am tired of cleaning up after others.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"@George, I agree. The fuel receipts will show who drives and who doesn't.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Minato,,"@Misaki, yes! If we know the fuel, we know the real cost.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,George,,I will check the other households and our own past checking spell.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
