35,2,1,talk,George,,The other households said asking favours sours things. Our checking spell was the worst.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Toshio,,The diary shows Saturday is three times Tuesday. The mechanic says short runs eat brakes.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Victoria,,It was taken over with the fuel light on twice. The weekly trips keep collapsing.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Misaki,,Two people bought half the fuel. One barely drives. The heavy weeks cost evenings.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Minato,,"The tax and insurance are 280,000 yen. The fuel is lopsided. I am shocked.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,George,,"@Minato, 280,000 yen is a lot. We need a system that stops the favours.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Victoria, if the weekly trips collapse, the whole week is ruined. We need predictability.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Toshio, predictability is everything. I cannot drive a dirty car with no fuel.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Minato, if two people drive half the time, an even split is unfair.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Minato,,"@Misaki, that is true. I just want to know the real number.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,George,,"@Misaki, fairness is the root. If it feels unfair, we stop talking.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Toshio,,"@George, I agree. But the mechanic says short runs are bad. We need longer trips.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Victoria,,"@Toshio, I don't care about the brakes. I care about the fuel light.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Misaki,,"@Victoria, the fuel light is a symptom. The cause is the lack of a rule.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Minato,,"@Misaki, a rule sounds good. I don't want to guess anymore.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,George,,We need to stop the favour-asking.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Toshio,,"We need to stop the short, wasteful runs.","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Victoria,,We need to stop the dirty handovers.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Misaki,,We need to stop the uneven burden.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Minato,,We need to stop the guessing.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
