60,3,1,talk,George,,Option A uses a calendar. It stops the favour-asking. I like it.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Toshio,,Option A records distance. It solves the short run problem. I support it.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Victoria,,Option A means I book it. I can check the state before I go.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Misaki,,Option A divides by distance. That is fair for the fuel.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Minato,,Option A sounds clear. I like knowing the cost per trip.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,George,,"@Toshio, yes. The calendar makes it official. No more asking.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Toshio,,"@George, exactly. It removes the evening of arranging.","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Misaki, if I book it, I can ensure it is ready.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Victoria, that is a good point. The booker is responsible.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Minato,,"@George, I am happy with this. It feels peaceful.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,George,,Option B is fixed days. But what if I don't use my day?,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Toshio,,Option B wastes the car. Option C relies on one person.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Victoria,,Option C means I am always the keeper. I don't want that.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Misaki,,Option B is unfair if my day is quiet. Option A is better.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Minato,,Option A is the best. I vote for it.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,George,,I vote for A. It stops the souring.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Toshio,,I vote for A. It saves my evenings.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,Victoria,,I vote for A. It gives me control.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,Misaki,,I vote for A. It is the fairest split.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Minato,,I vote for A. It is clear and kind.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
